# Keep the packaging recipe and CI configuration out of the auto-generated
# source archives (GitHub's /archive/refs/tags/<tag>.tar.gz and git archive).
#
# The PKGBUILD records the SHA-256 of the release source archive. If that archive
# contained the PKGBUILD itself, the recorded checksum would be self-referential
# (the archive's hash would depend on a file that stores its own hash), which is
# impossible to satisfy for the tagged commit. Excluding the packaging recipe
# makes the archive a pure function of the build inputs that the PKGBUILD needs
# (gui/, driver/, analysis/phase3/excalibur-wmi.c, LICENSE, ...), so the checksum
# is stable and verifiable.
packaging/ export-ignore
.github/ export-ignore
